      "comment": "ORARA BOB (8) had been in super honest form hitting the frame two times on end before finishing fourth (25.55) at this track last time. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ORARA JAKO (7) tends to take a while to wind up, missing the placings two back but running on to last time finishing third (20.30) in a Grade 5 at this track. Comes through a solid form race last start. Expected to feature again. KICK UP SON (2) settled midfield in the run and boxed on to finish there when 4th (20.37) at this track. Can figure in the finish. ALL ON AL (1) can add to a sequence of top-three finishes.",
